  "ai": {
    "difficulty": {
      "easy": "Fails to account for Doubles. Leads the King of Hearts in the Barbu round if they have no other hearts. Struggles with Domino blocking.",
      "medium": "Understands 'Breaking Hearts' logic. Uses Doubles against the current leader when holding a safe hand. Plays Domino with basic blocking logic.",
      "hard": "Simulates all 13! card permutations to find the safest leads. Perfectly calculates the 'Differential' for Doubles. Advanced Domino 'King-Pin' strategies to trap opponents."
    },
    "considerations": [
      "Requires 7 distinct sub-agents (one per contract logic).",
